msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio-on-rpi2.rst:16
#: 411d96aba55c462f92fefc530f16d5be
msgid ""
"These instructions clarify how to build ArduPilot for the NAVIO+ board on "
"the NAVIO+'s RPi2 board itself using Waf build system.  These instructions "
"assume the RPi2 has already been setup according to the manufacturer's (i.e."
" Emlid's) instructions `here <http://docs.emlid.com/Navio-APM/configuring-"
"raspberry-pi/>`__."
msgstr ""
"这些说明阐明了如何使用 Waf 构建系统在 NAVIO+ 的 RPi2 开发板本身上为 NAVIO+ 开发板构建 ArduPilot。这些说明假设 "
"RPi2 已按照制造商（即 Emlid）的说明在 `此处 <http://docs.emlid.com/Navio-APM/configuring-"
"raspberry-pi/>`__ 完成设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio-on-rpi2.rst:22
#: 374ce06d9e3a4dd3925bc177cfd639f6
msgid ""
"Alternatively you can follow Emlid's instructions on how to build from "
"source found `here <http://docs.emlid.com/Navio-APM/building-from-"
"sources/>`__."
msgstr ""
"或者您可以按照 Emlid 关于从源代码构建的说明，可在 `此处 <http://docs.emlid.com/Navio-APM/building-"
"from-sources/>`__ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio-on-rpi2.rst:27
#: cea0ee7cd41e4d2ea454df1457a61a21
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-navio-on-rpi2.rst:29
#: 95822c8125a04a5a9dc3d1d80daaf0b3
msgid ""
"Use an ssh terminal program such as `Putty <http://www.putty.org/>`__ to log"
" into the NAVIO+ board's RPI2."
msgstr "使用 SSH 终端程序（如 `Putty <http://www.putty.org/>`__）登录到 NAVIO+ 开发板的 RPI2。"

